  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Now, the cell reaction is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Li</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Li</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math><br /><br />We know that,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>RT</mi><mi>nF</mi></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.303</mo><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi>nF</mi></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>Li</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>5.92</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8.314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>298</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn>